<title>HUNGARY: Hungary six-month T-bill yield drops to 19.55 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary six-month T-bill yield drops to 19.55 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's six-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 19.55 percent, down from 19.71 percent set at an auction held two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     16,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	31,500.64 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    16,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 17,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    19.55 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     91.1177 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
